  "notes": "Geometric and light only near «وكفى بالله وليا… نصيرا». A scroll for «الكلم». Their insulting words «سمعنا وعصينا / واسمع غير مسمع» get no gloss (no excerpt repeats the insult); 46:14-17 explains it as an insult hidden in a word. No people drawn. STAGING v4: 45 stays ambient: His knowledge, protection and help (names and attributes). 46: a part of the Jews (Al-Muyassar: من اليهود فريق) acts, the rest (h) does nothing: they speak (distorting the words, scroll plate), shake their heads on their disobedience (46:10) and on reviling the religion (46:17); the Prophet they address is not shown. The counterfactual of 46:20-30 is not acted (wide shot). Nobody fades on the curse (46:32); they turn away on their disbelief (46:34). The little faith of 46:37-38 is not drawn as a count."
